WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:04.170
Captioning Provided By:
MTV NETWORKS
字幕提供者：
MTV 网络

00:04.254 --> 00:05.171
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.255 --> 00:06.339
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:06.423 --> 00:07.507
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.590 --> 00:08.800
Kids:
aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.883 --> 00:11.469
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.553 --> 00:13.513
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.596 --> 00:15.265
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.348 --> 00:17.475
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.559 --> 00:19.227
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.310 --> 00:21.563
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.646 --> 00:23.273
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.356 --> 00:25.316
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.400 --> 00:26.526
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.609 --> 00:27.610
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.861 --> 00:29.446
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.529 --> 00:31.531
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.614 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:36.870
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

01:16.701 --> 01:23.249
If it gets any hotter in here,
we're gonna have to put
fried calamari on the menu.
如果这里再热一点
我们必须把
菜单上有炸鱿鱼。

01:23.333 --> 01:26.920
It's a good thing
that new ceiling fan
Mr. Krabs installed
这是一件好事
那个新吊扇
蟹老板安装了

01:27.003 --> 01:28.797
is still working.
仍在工作。

01:29.964 --> 01:31.633
Were you talking to me,
Squidward?
你是在跟我说话吗
章鱼哥？

01:31.716 --> 01:32.926
Mr. Krabs, the fuh-fuh...
蟹老板先生，呃呃……

01:33.009 --> 01:35.887
Ooh, good word, boy.
哦，好话，孩子。

01:35.970 --> 01:37.597
Don't sneak up on me like that.
别这样偷袭我。

01:37.680 --> 01:39.849
The... fan... eh...
那个……粉丝……呃……

01:39.933 --> 01:41.601
You're not wearing shoes, lad.
小伙子，你没穿鞋。

01:41.684 --> 01:43.770
You're not going
"section eight" on me, are you?
你不会去
“第八节”对我来说，是吗？

01:43.853 --> 01:46.397
I was wearing shoes, they...
我穿着鞋子，他们...

01:46.481 --> 01:49.609
It's so hot, they melted off.
天气太热了，它们都融化了。

01:49.692 --> 01:50.652
Melted off?
融化了？

01:50.735 --> 01:52.904
The fan stopped working.
风扇停止运转。

01:52.987 --> 01:54.614
Huh?
啊？

01:54.697 --> 01:57.617
Mr. Krabs, you didn't
forget to pay the power bill
again, did you?
蟹老板，你没有
忘记支付电费
再说一遍，是吗？

01:57.700 --> 01:59.702
Of course not.
当然不是。

01:59.953 --> 02:03.540
Here, just fan yourself
with some of this junk mail
I keep finding in my mailbox.
在这里，给自己扇风
一些垃圾邮件
我一直在我的邮箱里寻找。

02:05.166 --> 02:07.627
That reminds me,
where are all me customers?
这让我想起，
我所有的顾客都在哪里？

02:07.710 --> 02:10.588
Probably out enjoying this
beautiful day
可能正在享受这个
美好的一天

02:10.672 --> 02:12.465
where it was  meant
to be enjoyed.
它的意思在哪里
被享受。

02:12.549 --> 02:14.592
Could you be
a little more specific?
你能是
更具体一点吗？

02:14.676 --> 02:15.635
They're at the beach.
他们在海滩上。

02:15.718 --> 02:17.303
Boys, I forgot to tell you.
孩子们，我忘了告诉你们。

02:17.387 --> 02:20.598
Close up shop,
we're going to the beach today.
关店，
我们今天要去海滩。

02:28.064 --> 02:29.274
Krabs: Ahoy there...
螃蟹：嘿嘿……

02:29.357 --> 02:30.316
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:30.400 --> 02:32.443
My name is Eugene Krabs.
我叫尤金·克拉布斯。

02:32.527 --> 02:35.321
And I would like to know if
I can interest either one of you
我想知道是否
我可以对你们中的任何一个感兴趣

02:35.405 --> 02:38.992
in a fresh, delicious Krabby
Patty fresh off the grill.
新鲜美味的蟹肉
刚从烤架上下来的帕蒂。

02:39.075 --> 02:40.076
Are they free?
他们免费吗？

02:40.159 --> 02:43.454
Yes, today they're
only $3... each.
是的，今天他们
每个仅需 3 美元。

02:43.538 --> 02:47.125
Sounds great, but I left
my wallet up on the sand.
听起来不错，但我离开了
我的钱包在沙子上。

02:47.208 --> 02:48.251
I told you.
我告诉你了。

02:48.334 --> 02:49.377
Sandy: Yee....
桑迪：是啊……

02:49.460 --> 02:50.712
What?
什么？

02:50.795 --> 02:52.839
Sandy: Yee...
桑迪：是啊……

02:52.922 --> 02:56.634
...haw, I love the beach.
...哈，我喜欢海滩。

02:56.718 --> 02:59.012
Oh, that noise was Sandy.
哦，那声音是桑迪发出的。

02:59.095 --> 03:00.889
Y'all be careful.
你们都要小心。

03:00.972 --> 03:02.599
Looks like some
big  waves a-comin'.
看起来有些
大浪即将来临。

03:02.682 --> 03:03.725
Who are you?
你是谁？

03:03.975 --> 03:06.185
Either you buy a Patty
or get off me wave.
要么你买帕蒂
或者离开我挥手。

03:06.269 --> 03:08.688
Cowabunga.
科瓦邦加。

03:08.771 --> 03:10.189
What next?
接下来怎么办？

03:12.734 --> 03:14.027
oh, no, oh.
哦，不，哦。

03:14.110 --> 03:15.737
Aloha, Patrick.
阿罗哈，帕特里克。

03:15.820 --> 03:17.530
Hey there, young fellow.
嘿，年轻人。

03:17.614 --> 03:19.282
How'd you like to be
our first customer
你想成为怎样的人
我们的第一个客户

03:19.365 --> 03:21.534
in over 17 working days?
超过 17 个工作日？

03:21.618 --> 03:22.702
I'd love to.
我喜欢。

03:22.785 --> 03:25.038
Squidward, show him a menu.
章鱼哥，给他看一份菜单。

03:25.121 --> 03:26.789
Uh...
呃...

03:26.873 --> 03:28.166
I can't quite see it from here.
从这里我看不太清楚。

03:28.249 --> 03:30.585
I'll just have to
climb on board.
我只需要
爬上船。

03:32.295 --> 03:35.048
That's a good one, Patrick,
on "board."
这是一件好事，帕特里克，
在“板上”。

03:35.131 --> 03:36.257
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

03:36.341 --> 03:38.593
Careful, you're gonna
capsize us.
小心点，你会
使我们倾覆。

03:38.676 --> 03:40.178
Almost up.
快起来了

03:41.596 --> 03:42.597
You idiot.
你这个白痴。

03:42.680 --> 03:46.559
Oh, oh-oh-oh, oh...
噢噢噢噢...

03:46.643 --> 03:49.228
Eeh! Eeh!
呃！呃！

03:49.312 --> 03:51.731
Patrick, look out!
帕特里克，小心！

03:51.814 --> 03:53.232
Locals only.
仅限当地人。

03:53.316 --> 03:54.651
What'd she say?
她说什么？

04:05.286 --> 04:09.290
Wipeout...
消灭...

04:13.294 --> 04:17.924
What, where'd the beach go?
什么，海滩去哪儿了？

04:18.007 --> 04:20.218
These waters are calm.
这些水域很平静。

04:20.301 --> 04:22.136
Too calm.
太冷静了。

04:25.181 --> 04:26.683
Black sky.
黑色的天空。

04:32.522 --> 04:36.109
Waterspouts... Of blood?
水龙卷……血？

04:40.196 --> 04:43.366
Jelly donuts
falling from the sky?
果冻甜甜圈
从天上掉下来？

04:43.449 --> 04:45.451
What could this mean?
这意味着什么？

04:45.535 --> 04:47.662
There's only one logical answer.
只有一个合乎逻辑的答案。

04:47.745 --> 04:51.499
I've landed right in the middle
of Dutchman's Triangle.
我正好落在中间
荷兰人三角。

04:53.668 --> 04:56.254
Right above Davy Jones's locker.
就在戴维·琼斯的储物柜上方。

04:57.880 --> 05:00.967
In the Devil's Galley.
在魔鬼的厨房里。

05:13.104 --> 05:15.898
Guys, look.
伙计们，看。

05:23.406 --> 05:25.867
SpongeBob, what are you doing
with that seaweed?
海绵宝宝，你在做什么
用那个海藻？

05:25.950 --> 05:28.286
Just dragging it around.
只是拖着它到处走。

05:28.369 --> 05:29.871
Man: Hey there, ho-dads.
男人：嘿，爸爸们。

05:29.954 --> 05:31.998
Welcome to our remote island.
欢迎来到我们的偏远岛屿。

05:32.248 --> 05:32.999
Island?
岛？

05:33.082 --> 05:33.666
Island?
岛？

05:35.084 --> 05:38.379
That's right,  kemo sabe,  island.
没错，kemo sabe，岛屿。

05:38.463 --> 05:40.923
Although we sometimes
refer to it as an... island.
虽然我们有时
将其称为……岛屿。

05:41.007 --> 05:43.634
We were just in Goo Lagoon
selling Krabby Patties
我们刚刚在 Goo Lagoon
卖蟹肉饼

05:43.718 --> 05:46.179
when this big wave hit us,
now we're on an island?
当这大浪袭来时，
现在我们在一个岛上？

05:46.262 --> 05:48.848
The ocean works
in mysterious ways.
海洋工作
以神秘的方式。

05:48.931 --> 05:50.850
And waves.
还有波浪。

05:50.933 --> 05:53.311
Mysterious waves.
神秘的波浪。

05:53.394 --> 05:54.687
Om...
嗡...

05:54.771 --> 05:57.023
Om...
嗡...

05:57.106 --> 05:58.649
Well, how did you guys get here?
嗯，你们是怎么到这里来的？

05:58.733 --> 06:01.402
Oh, we've been here since we
dropped out of junior college.
哦，我们从那时起就一直在这里
大专退学。

06:01.486 --> 06:07.283
This is awesome Eddie, Big G.,
Chip and Silent Stan.
这真是太棒了埃迪，大G，
奇普和沉默的斯坦。

06:07.366 --> 06:08.367
And I'm Twitch.
我是抽搐。

06:08.451 --> 06:09.494
Why do they call you Twitch?
为什么他们叫你 Twitch？

06:09.577 --> 06:10.703
what?
什么？

06:10.787 --> 06:12.413
Never mind.
没关系。

06:12.497 --> 06:14.582
So what did you say this house
was made from again?
那你说这个房子怎么样
又是由什么制成的？

06:14.665 --> 06:15.708
Guano.
鸟粪。

06:15.792 --> 06:16.959
Right.
正确的。

06:17.293 --> 06:18.753
Well, it's been fun
hanging out with you guys
嗯，很有趣
和你们一起出去玩

06:18.836 --> 06:20.296
but Mr. Krabs didn't
give us the day off
但蟹老板没有
给我们放一天假

06:20.379 --> 06:22.090
so we gotta head back
to Goo Lagoon.
所以我们得回去
前往古泻湖。

06:22.173 --> 06:25.134
Well, you're miles from
that tourist trap now, dude.
好吧，你距离
that tourist trap now, dude.

06:25.218 --> 06:28.346
Yeah, the only way back
is to surf there.
是的，唯一的回头路
就是去那里冲浪。

06:28.429 --> 06:30.223
Only way...
必由之路...

06:30.306 --> 06:32.225
back... surfing?
回来...冲浪？

06:32.308 --> 06:34.102
Bikini Bottom?
比基尼底裤？

06:35.561 --> 06:38.064
I don't know how to surf.
我不知道如何冲浪。

06:40.024 --> 06:43.152
Wo-ho, chill out, little dude,
we can teach you.
哇哦，冷静点，小家伙，
我们可以教你。

06:43.236 --> 06:45.321
Cool.
凉爽的。

06:48.241 --> 06:50.159
Narrator: Ah,
learning how to surf.
旁白：啊，
学习如何冲浪。

06:50.368 --> 06:54.747
To some, it comes as easily as
eating an ice cream cone
on a hot day.
对某些人来说，这就像
吃一个蛋卷冰淇淋
在炎热的一天。

06:54.831 --> 06:57.375
Others... well...
其他的……呃……

06:57.458 --> 07:00.711
To them it's like eating
an ice cream cone on a cold day.
对他们来说就像吃饭一样
在寒冷的日子里吃一个蛋卷冰淇淋。

07:00.795 --> 07:06.717
Sometimes in surfing,
it's the approach that's
most important.
有时在冲浪时，
这就是方法
最重要的是。

07:06.801 --> 07:09.804
And sometimes, it's the retreat.
有时，这就是撤退。

07:12.473 --> 07:16.060
once in a lifetime,
that perfect wave comes along.
一生一次，
完美的波浪随之而来。

07:16.144 --> 07:17.770
Not too big, not too small.
不太大，也不太小。

07:17.854 --> 07:19.438
And the surfer
has to act fast...
还有冲浪者
必须快点行动……

07:19.522 --> 07:21.023
Go...
去...

07:21.107 --> 07:23.442
Narrator: Or he stands to miss
the ride of his life.
旁白：不然他就会错过
他一生的旅程。

07:23.526 --> 07:25.444
Hey, Patrick, want to
see something cool?
嘿，帕特里克，想要
看到很酷的东西吗？

07:25.528 --> 07:26.863
You bet.
你打赌。

07:26.946 --> 07:30.867
Down here.
下面这里。

07:30.950 --> 07:32.785
See, it's a picture
of Squidward.
你看，这是一张照片
章鱼哥。

07:32.869 --> 07:33.911
Wow...
哇...

07:34.120 --> 07:36.289
Narrator: But all in all,
in life...
旁白：但总而言之，
在生活中...

07:36.372 --> 07:41.294
It's not whether we win or lose,
but whether we get
totally stoked.
输赢并不重要
但我们是否得到
完全兴奋起来。

07:43.379 --> 07:45.339
Well, dudes, I give up.
好吧，兄弟们，我放弃了。

07:45.423 --> 07:46.465
What?
什么？

07:46.674 --> 07:48.759
These ho-dads are
impossible to teach.
这些老爸们是
不可能教的。

07:48.843 --> 07:52.346
especially the one
on the end over there.
尤其是那个
在那边的尽头。

07:53.890 --> 07:54.807
what's that?
那是什么？

07:57.977 --> 08:01.105
Oh, no, there's no way,
dude, he'd never do it.
哦不，没办法了
老兄，他永远不会这样做。

08:02.940 --> 08:04.734
what's he saying?
他在说什么？

08:05.026 --> 08:08.487
Eh, he reminded us
that there is one dude
who could possibly teach you...
呃，他提醒我们了
有一个家伙
谁能教你...

08:08.571 --> 08:09.822
If you can find him.
如果你能找到他的话。

08:09.906 --> 08:10.990
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

08:11.324 --> 08:13.451
His name,  ,
is Jack Kahuna Laguna.
他的名字，，
是杰克·卡胡纳·拉古纳。

08:13.534 --> 08:14.827
Or J.K.L. for short.
或者 J.K.L.简而言之。

08:14.911 --> 08:16.245
Aw, man.
噢，伙计。

08:16.579 --> 08:20.166
We say that legend says that
J.K.L. was last seen upriver
我们说传说是这样说的
J.K.L.最后一次出现是在上游

08:20.249 --> 08:24.170
at the Kahamamoku Cove
where every wave is perfect.
在卡哈马莫库湾
每一个波浪都是完美的。

08:24.253 --> 08:27.173
Will there be nachos there?
那里会有玉米片吗？

08:28.883 --> 08:31.427
Thanks again for letting us
borrow these surfboards, Twitch.
再次感谢您让我们
借用这些冲浪板，Twitch。

08:31.510 --> 08:32.970
no problem.
没问题。

08:33.054 --> 08:34.931
And just keep following
the river straight up
并继续关注
河水笔直向上

08:35.014 --> 08:37.934
till you hit Kahamamoku Cove,
can't miss it.
直到你到达卡哈马莫库湾，
不能错过它。

08:38.017 --> 08:39.393
How far upstream
did you say it was?
上游多远
你说是吗？

08:39.477 --> 08:41.354
Well, we don't know
嗯，我们不知道

08:41.437 --> 08:42.855
'cause we've never
ever been there.
因为我们从来没有
曾经去过那里。

08:42.939 --> 08:44.565
We're deathly afraid
of this river
我们害怕极了
这条河的

08:44.649 --> 08:46.984
and wouldn't even set foot in it
if you paid us.
甚至不会涉足其中
如果你付钱给我们。

08:47.068 --> 08:49.904
Yeah, interpret that
any way you want.
是的，解释一下
任何你想要的方式。

08:57.536 --> 09:00.957
Oh, where am I?
噢，我在哪儿？

09:02.708 --> 09:04.543
Where is everybody?
大家都在哪里？

09:07.421 --> 09:08.798
I'm stranded.
我被困了。

09:08.881 --> 09:10.675
SpongeBob, where are you?
海绵宝宝，你在哪里？

09:10.758 --> 09:17.598
Man: ♪ I make a beeline
for the tree line ♪
男人：♪ 我径直走
为了树线♪

09:17.682 --> 09:23.062
♪ Getting back to nature
always does me good ♪
♪ 回归自然
总是对我有好处♪

09:23.145 --> 09:29.860
♪ I'll make a beeline
for the tree line ♪
♪ 我会径直走
为了树线♪

09:29.944 --> 09:35.157
♪ I just can't wait
to get back in the woods ♪
♪ 我已经等不及了
回到树林里♪

09:35.241 --> 09:39.328
♪ And when I need to
close my eyes and dream ♪
♪ 当我需要时
闭上眼睛做梦吧♪

09:39.412 --> 09:41.289
♪ Beside a quiet
mountain stream... ♪
♪ 安静的旁边
山间溪流...♪

09:46.752 --> 09:52.925
Man: ♪ That's when I make
a beeline for the tree line ♪
男人：♪ 那是我做的
径直走向林线 ♪

09:55.052 --> 10:01.434
Man: ♪ Beeline for
the tree line. ♪
男人：♪ 直奔
树线。 ♪

10:03.102 --> 10:04.061
Could you pull over here?
你能把车停在这儿吗？

10:04.145 --> 10:05.396
I gotta tie my shoe.
我得系鞋带。

10:05.479 --> 10:07.148
Again?
再次？

10:11.652 --> 10:14.030
SpongeBob: "Welcome to
Kahamamoku Cove."
海绵宝宝：“欢迎来到
卡哈马莫库湾。”

10:14.113 --> 10:15.781
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.
: J.K.L.

10:15.865 --> 10:17.742
Guys, guys...
伙计们，伙计们……

10:17.825 --> 10:22.246
I found the cove.
我找到了海湾。

10:22.330 --> 10:25.625
I bet this guy
won't even be here.
我打赌这个人
甚至不会在这里。

10:25.708 --> 10:29.295
If he's anything like that
last group of dirty drop-outs...
如果他是这样的话
最后一批肮脏的退学者...

10:29.378 --> 10:32.673
Oh, don't worry, Squidward,
he'll be here.
哦，别担心，章鱼哥，
他会在这里。

10:32.757 --> 10:34.216
You've never even seen him.
你甚至从未见过他。

10:34.425 --> 10:36.969
You have got to stop judging
people by the way they look.
你必须停止评判
人们从他们的外表来看。

10:38.512 --> 10:39.513
you're right.
你说得对。

10:39.597 --> 10:40.348
Look.
看。

10:44.226 --> 10:46.520
It's him.
是他。

10:50.941 --> 10:53.110
oh, my...
哦，我的...

11:00.034 --> 11:03.037
It's J.K.L.
这是 J.K.L.

11:07.750 --> 11:12.004
Hail, O Great Swami
of the Gnarly Pounders.
伟大的斯瓦米啊，万岁
粗糙的磅兵。

11:12.088 --> 11:13.422
We seek audience with thee.
我们寻求您的接见。

11:13.506 --> 11:16.550
Plus we want to talk to you.
另外我们想和你谈谈。

11:16.634 --> 11:20.054
Will you teach us how to surf,
O Great One?
你能教我们如何冲浪吗
伟大的一位啊？

11:20.137 --> 11:24.016
So we may get back home?
那么我们可以回家了吗？

11:24.100 --> 11:26.394
Uh...
呃...

11:26.477 --> 11:27.978
Are you gonna teach us
how to surf
你要教我们吗
如何冲浪

11:28.062 --> 11:31.273
or are we just gonna stand here
and stare at you all day?
或者我们就站在这里
整天盯着你看？

11:31.357 --> 11:35.236
I kind of like staring at him.
我有点喜欢盯着他看。

11:44.745 --> 11:47.706
I've never seen
anything more beautiful,
have you, Patrick?
我从未见过
任何更美丽的东西，
你有吗，帕特里克？

11:47.790 --> 11:51.293
Not since I saw my first
triple-layer cheesecake.
自从我第一次见到以来就没有
三层芝士蛋糕。

11:52.920 --> 11:56.715
That... was your first lesson.
那...是你的第一课。

12:00.928 --> 12:02.721
What, you call that a lesson?
什么，你管这叫教训？

12:02.805 --> 12:06.308
We just stood here
and watched you surf
for two-and-a-half hours.
我们只是站在这里
看着你冲浪
两个半小时。

12:12.398 --> 12:15.317
Just keep breathing.
只要保持呼吸即可。

12:21.282 --> 12:24.618
or locusts- Call Larry.
或蝗虫——打电话给拉里。

12:24.702 --> 12:26.078
Oh, look, Cashy.
哦，看，卡希。

12:27.997 --> 12:29.582
Earrings.
耳环。

12:29.665 --> 12:33.210
Well, Cashy, I guess
the Devil's Galley isn't so bad.
嗯，卡希，我想
魔鬼厨房并没有那么糟糕。

12:33.294 --> 12:35.588
As long as that
Flying Dutchman doesn't appear
只要那样
飞翔的荷兰人号没有出现

12:35.671 --> 12:37.715
and stick us in
Davy Jones's locker.
并把我们困在
戴维·琼斯的储物柜。

12:39.175 --> 12:40.843
but that won't happen,
will it, Cashy?
但这不会发生，
会吗，卡希？

12:43.971 --> 12:44.930
Ow.
噢。

12:45.264 --> 12:47.433
it's
the Flying Dutchman.
这是
飞翔的荷兰人号。

12:47.516 --> 12:51.270
It's some guy
I've never seen before.
这是某个家伙
我以前从未见过。

12:51.353 --> 12:57.234
Argh, who be disturbing
the Flying Dutchman's walk home
from the convenience store?
唉，谁打扰了
飞翔的荷兰人号步行回家
从便利店？

12:57.318 --> 12:58.611
You've even spilled me milk.
你连牛奶都洒给我了。

12:58.694 --> 13:01.822
Well, there ain't no use
crying over it.
嗯，没有什么用
为之哭泣。

13:04.700 --> 13:07.286
Don't worry, Cashy,
I'll protect ye.
别担心，卡西，
我会保护你们。

13:13.042 --> 13:16.378
Isn't Jack Kahuna Laguna the
most totally awesome surf guru
杰克·卡胡纳·拉古纳不是
最棒的冲浪大师

13:16.462 --> 13:17.838
you've ever met, Squidward?
你见过吗，章鱼哥？

13:17.922 --> 13:19.507
I don't know about you two
我不了解你们两个

13:19.590 --> 13:21.509
but I'd like to get out of here
at some point.
但我想离开这里
在某个时刻。

13:21.592 --> 13:24.178
And if his idea
of teaching us is...
如果他的想法
教导我们的是...

13:26.388 --> 13:28.182
Oh, wonderful.
哦，太棒了。

13:28.265 --> 13:31.227
Quiet, Squidward,
I think we're about to
receive another lesson.
安静，章鱼哥，
我想我们即将
接受另一堂课。

13:55.125 --> 13:58.337
Just keep breathing.
只要保持呼吸即可。

14:01.257 --> 14:02.466
That's it?
就是这样？

14:02.550 --> 14:04.718
I just want to go home.
我只想回家。

14:04.802 --> 14:07.471
Would it make you feel better if
I went and talked to him?
如果
我去跟他说话了？

14:07.555 --> 14:12.268
Oh, thank you,
thank you, SpongeBob.
哦，谢谢你，
谢谢你，海绵宝宝。

14:12.351 --> 14:13.519
Well, did you talk to him?
嗯，你跟他谈过吗？

14:13.602 --> 14:14.520
Yep.
是的。

14:14.603 --> 14:15.938
And?
和？

14:16.021 --> 14:18.691
He said, we just have to
stare into this fire all night
他说，我们只需要
整夜凝视这火焰

14:18.774 --> 14:20.568
and the secrets
will be revealed.
和秘密
将被揭晓。

14:20.651 --> 14:23.237
We're gonna be
stuck here forever.
我们将会是
永远被困在这里。

14:27.491 --> 14:29.535
Well, Sandy,
using only your bare hands
嗯，桑迪，
只用你的双手

14:29.618 --> 14:31.662
and the resources found on
this deserted island
以及在以下位置找到的资源
这个荒岛

14:31.745 --> 14:34.206
you have not only survived
but thrived.
你不仅活了下来
但蓬勃发展。

14:34.290 --> 14:36.166
You built a five-star hotel...
你建了一座五星级酒店...

14:36.250 --> 14:38.168
a steam-powered generator...
蒸汽发电机...

14:38.252 --> 14:39.920
a car that runs on
coconut milk...
一辆行驶的汽车
椰奶...

14:40.004 --> 14:41.964
And even an espresso bar.
甚至还有浓缩咖啡吧。

14:42.047 --> 14:45.759
I almost don't want to leave,
but I miss Bikini Bottom.
我几乎不想离开
但我想念比基尼泳裤。

14:45.843 --> 14:49.763
Now I can find SpongeBob and
the gang and fly us right back.
现在我可以找到海绵宝宝了
帮我们马上飞回来。

14:49.847 --> 14:52.516
Acorn-One to tower,
request clearance.
橡子一到塔，
请求许可。

14:52.600 --> 14:56.895
Roger, Acorn-One,
you are cleared for take-off.
罗杰，橡子一号，
您已获准起飞。

15:03.235 --> 15:04.903
oh, please, Mr. Dutchman.
哦，拜托，达奇曼先生。

15:04.987 --> 15:06.947
I didn't mean to
spill your groceries.
我不是故意的
弄洒你的杂货。

15:07.281 --> 15:11.243
Well, normally I wouldn't mind,
but I'm a little low
on cash this month.
嗯，一般情况下我不会介意，
但我有点低
这个月现金。

15:11.327 --> 15:13.579
So I have no way to pay
for more.
所以我没办法付款
了解更多。

15:13.662 --> 15:17.249
Unless  you  have
some money I can borrow.
除非你有
我可以借一些钱。

15:17.333 --> 15:19.418
No, I... Cashy.
不，我……卡西。

15:19.501 --> 15:23.589
Please, Cashy is
the closest thing to a friend
I've ever had.
拜托，卡西是
最接近朋友的事
我曾经有过。

15:32.181 --> 15:37.102
please tell me you two didn't
stare at that fire all night.
请告诉我你们两个没有
整夜盯着那堆火。

15:37.186 --> 15:38.896
Okay.
好的。

15:38.979 --> 15:40.939
All right, I'm done.
好吧，我已经完成了。

15:41.023 --> 15:43.025
Hey, Blondie.
嘿，金发女郎。

15:43.108 --> 15:45.778
Teach me how to surf so I can
go home, or I'm gonna...
教我如何冲浪，这样我就可以
回家吧，不然我就……

15:45.861 --> 15:50.366
You obviously didn't
stare into the fire all night
like your friends over there.
你显然没有
整夜盯着火
就像你那边的朋友一样。

15:52.910 --> 15:57.373
Those dudes are gonna make
awesome surfers.
那些家伙会做
很棒的冲浪者。

16:03.629 --> 16:06.298
SpongeBob: Where's he going?
海绵宝宝：他要去哪儿？

16:06.382 --> 16:08.759
Come on.
快点。

16:17.267 --> 16:22.147
Look, he's on top of that
big drinking fountain.
看，他在上面
大饮水机。

16:29.780 --> 16:31.490
J.K.L., is this the next part
of our training?
J.K.L.，这是下一部分吗
我们的训练？

16:35.577 --> 16:37.621
These clouds...
这些云...

16:37.705 --> 16:40.249
They can only mean one thing.
它们只能意味着一件事。

16:40.332 --> 16:43.377
Increased chance
of precipitation?
增加机会
降水量？

16:45.379 --> 16:46.672
Yes.
是的。

16:46.755 --> 16:48.799
Every thousand years or so
每隔一千年左右

16:48.882 --> 16:52.052
the planets align in such a way
行星以这样的方式排列

16:52.136 --> 16:55.973
that a perfect wave is formed.
形成完美的波浪。

16:56.056 --> 16:57.558
A perfect wave?
完美的波浪？

16:57.641 --> 17:00.978
The world's biggest, fastest...
世界上最大、最快...

17:01.061 --> 17:03.772
longest, gnarliest...
最长、最粗的...

17:03.856 --> 17:07.609
most totally awesome,
perfect wave.
最棒的是，
完美的波浪。

17:07.693 --> 17:10.529
They call it...
他们称之为...

17:10.612 --> 17:12.322
The Big One.
大一号。

17:12.406 --> 17:14.408
Hey, that's what
they used to call me.
嘿，就是这样
他们过去常给我打电话。

17:14.491 --> 17:17.494
It's probably
the only wave big enough
大概是
唯一足够大的波浪

17:17.578 --> 17:20.956
for you to ride all the way
to Bikini Bottom.
为你一路骑行
到比基尼底部。

17:21.039 --> 17:25.544
You'll have to catch it,
or you'll be stuck here...
你必须抓住它，
否则你会被困在这里...

17:25.794 --> 17:27.713
Forever.
永远。

17:30.632 --> 17:32.384
The Big One...
大一号...

17:32.468 --> 17:36.472
is almost upon us.
快到了。

17:37.556 --> 17:40.392
Please, please, Mr. Dutchman.
拜托，拜托，达奇曼先生。

17:40.476 --> 17:42.186
Let Cashy go.
放开卡西吧

17:42.269 --> 17:46.565
I promise I'll never
soil your waters again.
我保证我永远不会
再次弄脏你的水。

17:46.648 --> 17:47.983
Ya promise?
雅答应吗？

17:48.192 --> 17:51.945
Oh, yes, I promise on my
dear Aunt Sally's false teeth.
哦，是的，我保证
亲爱的莎莉阿姨的假牙。

17:52.029 --> 17:53.739
Liar!
说谎者！

17:55.991 --> 17:57.117
What?
什么？

17:57.201 --> 17:59.578
Your Aunt Sally doesn't
wear false teeth.
你的莎莉阿姨没有
戴假牙。

17:59.661 --> 18:00.788
How do you know?
你怎么知道？

18:00.871 --> 18:03.582
Because I dated her
in high school.
因为我和她约会过
在高中。

18:03.665 --> 18:06.293
No...
不...

18:06.376 --> 18:08.504
Whoops.
哎呀。

18:09.963 --> 18:12.257
This weather sure is dangerous.
这种天气确实很危险。

18:12.341 --> 18:13.801
I'd better be careful.
我最好小心一点。

18:13.884 --> 18:17.137
Mayday, mayday, I'm going down.
五月天，五月天，我要下去了。

18:17.221 --> 18:18.722
Repeat, down.
重复，向下。

18:18.806 --> 18:22.100
And now, just to make sure
this never happens again...
现在，只是为了确保
这种事再也不会发生了……

18:22.184 --> 18:25.020
I'm gonna send you on
a little trip down to...
我会送你去
一小段旅行到...

18:25.103 --> 18:26.647
Oh, ow, ooh, ow, ooh.
噢，噢，噢，噢，噢。

18:26.730 --> 18:28.524
Uh... Where is that, exactly?
呃……那到底是哪里？

18:31.610 --> 18:34.196
Sandy: Mayday...
桑迪：五月天……

18:37.241 --> 18:39.368
all alone again.
再次孤身一人。

18:40.285 --> 18:41.703
Cashy.
现金。

18:45.374 --> 18:46.458
What the?
什么？

18:46.542 --> 18:48.210
Tube sock?
管袜？

18:48.293 --> 18:49.336
But that means...
但这意味着...

18:49.419 --> 18:51.129
Yeah, that's right, baby.
是的，没错，宝贝。

18:51.213 --> 18:54.466
Welcome to my locker.
欢迎来到我的储物柜。

18:57.553 --> 19:00.472
♪ For a daydream believer
and a homecoming queen ♪
♪ 对于白日梦信徒
还有返校节女王♪

19:02.099 --> 19:03.267
The Monkees: ♪ Cheer up,
sleepy Jean ♪
Monkees：♪ 振作起来，
困倦的吉恩 ♪

19:06.562 --> 19:09.022
The Monkees: ♪ Oh, what can... ♪
Monkees 乐队：♪ 哦，什么可以……♪

19:09.106 --> 19:11.608
J.K.L.: Get ready, dudes,
it's coming.
J.K.L.：准备好，伙计们，
它来了。

19:11.692 --> 19:14.653
J.K.L., thanks for
teaching us how to surf.
J.K.L.，谢谢
教我们如何冲浪。

19:14.736 --> 19:16.655
Little dude...
小家伙...

19:16.738 --> 19:19.658
I didn't teach you anything
you didn't already know.
我没有教你任何东西
你还不知道。

19:19.741 --> 19:22.160
Here it comes.
它来了。

19:22.244 --> 19:25.622
Well, J.K.L., I guess
this is good-bye.
嗯，J.K.L.，我想
这是再见。

19:25.706 --> 19:30.878
Wait, there's something
I forgot to tell you.
等等，有件事
我忘了告诉你。

19:30.961 --> 19:33.505
In return for its awesomeness...
作为对它的敬畏的回报......

19:33.589 --> 19:38.844
The Big One  always
demands a sacrifice.
永远是大佬
要求做出牺牲。

19:38.927 --> 19:43.265
One of you will not return.
你们中的一个人不会回来。

19:44.141 --> 19:46.268
I volunteer SpongeBob.
我自愿担任海绵宝宝。

19:46.351 --> 19:48.353
Keep paddling, Patrick.
继续划桨，帕特里克。

19:48.437 --> 19:52.900
This wind feels like
broken glass mixed with
razor blades.
这风感觉就像
碎玻璃混有
剃须刀刀片。

19:52.983 --> 19:55.193
SpongeBob: It's the big one!
海绵宝宝：好大的一个！

19:59.448 --> 20:00.866
No!
不！

20:07.581 --> 20:09.708
Hey, I was gonna eat that.
嘿，我正想吃那个呢。

20:09.791 --> 20:11.585
Patrick, grab on.
帕特里克，抓紧。

20:14.254 --> 20:16.673
Hang on, Squidward.
坚持住，章鱼哥。

20:18.967 --> 20:20.469
This is it.
就是这样。

20:20.552 --> 20:22.888
Time for those lessons
to pay off.
是时候学习这些课程了
还清。

20:22.971 --> 20:24.806
Look, that's
Mr. Krabs down there.
看，那是
螃蟹先生在下面。

20:24.890 --> 20:28.226
You like it when I comb
your hair, don't you, Cashy?
你喜欢我梳头的时候
你的头发，不是吗，卡希？

20:28.310 --> 20:30.395
Mr. Krabs, hop on
蟹老板，上车吧

20:30.479 --> 20:32.731
or you'll be stuck here forever.
否则你会永远被困在这里。

20:32.814 --> 20:34.650
Who said that?
谁说的？

20:34.733 --> 20:37.277
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

20:37.361 --> 20:40.280
I never even got a chance
to tell him that I...
我什至没有机会
告诉他我...

20:40.364 --> 20:41.573
J.K.L.: Looking for this?
J.K.L.：在找这个吗？

20:41.657 --> 20:43.200
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.

20:43.283 --> 20:44.534
And Mr. Krabs.
还有蟹老板。

20:44.618 --> 20:45.953
And Cashy.
还有卡希。

20:48.956 --> 20:51.875
Cashy!
现金！

20:52.668 --> 20:54.586
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.
J.K.L.

20:54.670 --> 20:56.588
No!
不！

20:56.672 --> 20:57.923
Little dude...
小家伙...

20:58.006 --> 21:02.761
I was born to do this.
我生来就是为了做这件事。

21:07.599 --> 21:11.311
I guess this big one
prefers a high-protein meal.
我猜这个很大
更喜欢高蛋白膳食。

21:11.395 --> 21:13.981
Now what're we gonna do?
现在我们要做什么？

21:31.373 --> 21:33.083
You hear a noise?
你听到有声音吗？

21:37.421 --> 21:39.298
Everybody, look.
大家看一下。

21:39.381 --> 21:40.382
A you-foe.
一个你的敌人。

21:40.465 --> 21:41.717
A spaceman.
一个太空人。

21:41.800 --> 21:44.136
Don't make any
funny moves, spaceman.
不要做任何
有趣的动作，太空人。

21:44.219 --> 21:46.638
You're not conquering
our world without a fight.
你没有征服
我们的世界没有战斗。

21:46.722 --> 21:48.640
I'm not a spaceman,
you dunderhead.
我不是太空人
你这个笨蛋。

21:48.724 --> 21:51.852
It's me, Sandy,
SpongeBob's friend.
是我，桑迪，
海绵宝宝的朋友。

21:54.396 --> 21:58.650
Shucks, now I'll never
find SpongeBob and Patrick.
糟糕，现在我永远不会
找到海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

21:58.734 --> 21:59.651
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

21:59.735 --> 22:00.777
My friends.
我的朋友们。

22:01.028 --> 22:03.321
They went surfing
and never returned.
他们去冲浪了
再也没有回来。

22:03.405 --> 22:06.992
Is one of them, like,
a little square dude
with big teeth?
是其中之一，比如，
一个小方形的家伙
有大牙齿？

22:07.075 --> 22:09.244
You some kind of mind-reader?
你是读心术的人吗？

22:09.327 --> 22:10.871
No.
不。

